#. type: Plain text
#: build/C/man7/cgroup_namespaces.7:171
msgid ""
"The virtualization provided by cgroup namespaces serves a number of purposes:"
msgstr ""

#. type: IP
#: build/C/man7/cgroup_namespaces.7:171 build/C/man7/cgroup_namespaces.7:177
